From 1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Signals: include cstdint for uintptr_t

Do not rely on a transitive include to define uintptr_t. GCC 13's standard
library headers expose the missing direct dependency.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
 llvm/include/llvm/Support/Signals.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/llvm/include/llvm/Support/Signals.h b/llvm/include/llvm/Support/Signals.h
--- a/llvm/include/llvm/Support/Signals.h
+++ b/llvm/include/llvm/Support/Signals.h
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #ifndef LLVM_SUPPORT_SIGNALS_H
 #define LLVM_SUPPORT_SIGNALS_H
 
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <string>
 
 namespace llvm {
-- 
2.43.0

